msgid "Perfetto"
msgstr "Perfetto"

msgid ""
"Please see the :ref:`tracing profiler instructions <doc_tracing_profilers>` "
"for more information."
msgstr ""
"詳情請參閱 :ref:`tracing profiler instructions <doc_tracing_profilers>` 。"

msgid ""
"`Perfetto <https://perfetto.dev>`__ is the default tracing system for "
"Android. In fact, its system tracing service has been built into the "
"platform since Android 9."
msgstr ""
"`Perfetto <https://perfetto.dev>`__ 是安卓（Android）系統預設的效能追蹤工具。"
"事實上，它的系統追蹤服務從 Android 9 開始就已經內建在安卓平台里了。"

msgid "Using official Perfetto templates"
msgstr "使用官方提供的 Perfetto 範本"

msgid ""
"Starting with Godot 4.7, Perfetto export templates are provided for every "
"stable Godot release and can be downloaded from the `GitHub Releases page "
"<https://github.com/godotengine/godot/releases/>`_."
msgstr ""
"從 Godot 4.7 版本開始，官方發佈的每一個穩定版 Godot 都會附帶 Perfetto 匯出範"
"本，你可以直接從 `GitHub Releases page <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/"
"releases/>`_ 下載。"

msgid "Using the Gradle build template"
msgstr "使用 Gradle 建置範本"

msgid ""
"Navigate to the release page and download the "
"``Godot_v<godot_version>_android_source.perfetto.zip`` release artifact "
"where ``godot_version`` corresponds to the version of the engine being used."
msgstr ""
"請前往（GitHub）的 Release（發佈）頁面，下載名為 "
"``Godot_v<godot_version>_android_source.perfetto.zip`` 的發佈檔案。其中，"
"``godot_version`` 需要替換為你目前正在使用的引擎版本號。"

msgid ""
"In the **Project > Export** dialog, **Advanced Options** and **Use Gradle "
"Build** must be enabled."
msgstr ""
"在 **專案 > 匯出** 對話框中，必須啟用 **進階選項** 和 **使用 Gradle 建置**。"

msgid "Point **Android Source Template** to the downloaded export template."
msgstr ""
"請將 **Android Source Template（安卓原始碼範本）** 這一項，指向你剛剛下載好的"
"匯出範本檔案。"

msgid ""
"Follow the instructions in the :ref:`Configuration section "
"<doc_profiler_perfetto_configuration>` to learn how to configure and create "
"a trace."
msgstr ""
"請按照 :ref:`Configuration section <doc_profiler_perfetto_configuration>` 中"
"的說明，來瞭解如何設定並建立追蹤（trace）。"

msgid "Using non-gradle build templates"
msgstr "使用非 Gradle 建置範本"

msgid ""
"Navigate to the release page and download the following release artifacts "
"where ``godot_version`` corresponds to the version of the engine being used:"
msgstr ""
"請前往 Release（發佈）頁面，下載以下發佈產物（release artifacts）。注意，其中"
"的 ``godot_version`` 需要替換為你目前正在使用的引擎版本號。"

msgid ""
"``Godot_v<godot_version>_android_debug.perfetto.apk`` (for debug builds)"
msgstr "``Godot_v<godot_version>_android_debug.perfetto.apk`` (用於除錯建置)"

msgid ""
"``Godot_v<godot_version>_android_release.perfetto.apk`` (for release builds)"
msgstr "``Godot_v<godot_version>_android_release.perfetto.apk`` (用於發佈版本)"

msgid "In the **Project > Export** dialog:"
msgstr "在 **Project > Export** （專案 > 匯出）對話框中："

msgid "**Advanced Options** must be enabled"
msgstr "必須啟用 **進階選項**"

msgid "**Use Gradle Build** must be disabled"
msgstr "必須停用（關閉） **Use Gradle Build**"

msgid "Point **Custom Template** to the downloaded export templates."
msgstr "請將 **Custom Template** （自訂範本）指向你下載好的匯出範本檔案。"

msgid "Custom Godot builds with Perfetto support"
msgstr "帶 Perfetto 支援的自訂 Godot 建置"

msgid ""
"From the ``godot`` root directory, run the following python script to "
"install the latest version of the Perfetto SDK under ``thirdparty/perfetto``:"
msgstr ""
"在 ``godot`` 根目錄下，執行以下 Python 腳本，即可在 ``thirdparty/perfetto`` "
"路徑下安裝最新版本的 Perfetto SDK："

msgid ""
"Next, build the Android debug or release templates for your architecture "
"using ``scons`` (per :ref:`Compiling for Android "
"<doc_compiling_for_android>`), but adding the ``profiler=perfetto`` argument."
msgstr ""
"接下來，請參照《安卓平台編譯指南》（ :ref:`Compiling for Android "
"<doc_compiling_for_android>` ），使用 ``scons`` 為你的目標架構編譯 Android "
"的 debug 或 release 範本。不過，你需要額外加上 ``profiler=perfetto`` 這個參"
"數。"

msgid ""
"It's generally recommended to profile release templates, because that is the "
"version your players will use, and it will perform differently than other "
"types of builds. However, in the case of Android, it can sometimes be useful "
"to use debug templates, because Godot can only do remote debugging of games "
"exported from debug templates."
msgstr ""
"通常來說，建議使用 Release（發佈）範本來進行效能分析，因為這才是你的玩家們最"
"終會玩到的版本，而且它的執行表現會和其他型別的建置版本有所不同。不過，在安卓"
"（Android）這個特定情況下，使用 Debug（除錯）範本有時候也會很有用，因為 "
"Godot 只能對從 Debug 範本匯出的遊戲進行遠端除錯。"

msgid "For example, to build the release templates for arm64:"
msgstr "例如，要為 arm64 架構編譯發佈範本："

msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

msgid ""
"Perfetto requires a configuration file to tell it which events to track."
msgstr "Perfetto 需要一個設定檔案來告訴它具體應該追蹤哪些事件。"

msgid "Create a file called ``godot.config`` with this content:"
msgstr "建立一個名為 ``godot.config`` 的檔案，並填入以下內容："

msgid "Godot records two categories of track events:"
msgstr "Godot 會記錄兩類追蹤事件（track events）："

msgid ""
"**godot**: Used to record Godot engine events. This is used for performance "
"analysis. Event tracing overhead should not significantly impact "
"performance. This should be the typical tracing mode for most developers."
msgstr ""
"**godot** ：用於記錄 Godot 引擎事件。主要用於效能分析。事件追蹤的開銷不會顯著"
"影響效能。這應該是大多數開發者常用的追蹤模式。"

msgid ""
"**godot_scripting**: Used to record Godot scripting events. This is a slow "
"category as it profiles the entire game scripting logic. This is used for "
"code understanding / debugging / finding what caused a frame hitch. "
"Performance is much slower, but it helps to find that one problematic "
"function call that was otherwise hidden."
msgstr ""
"**godot_scripting**：用於記錄 Godot 腳本相關的事件。這是一個比較慢（開銷較"
"大）的類別，因為它會對整個遊戲的腳本邏輯進行效能分析。它通常用於理解程式碼邏"
"輯、除錯、或者找出到底是甚麼導致了遊戲畫面的瞬間卡頓（frame hitch）。開啟後效"
"能會明顯變慢，但它能幫你揪出那個平時隱藏很深、引發問題的特定函式呼叫。"

msgid "Record a trace"
msgstr "抓取追蹤記錄"

msgid ""
"Finally, launch your game on an Android device using the export templates "
"you built earlier."
msgstr ""
"最後，使用你之前自己編譯好的匯出範本，將你的遊戲啟動並執行在安卓裝置上。"

msgid ""
"When you're ready to record a trace (for example, when you've hit the part "
"of your game that is exhibiting performance issues), you can use `this "
"script from the Perfetto GitHub repository <https://github.com/google/"
"perfetto/blob/main/tools/record_android_trace>`_."
msgstr ""
"當您準備錄制追蹤資訊時（例如，當您已進入遊戲的某個部分併發現效能問題時），你"
"可以使用 `Perfetto GitHub倉庫中的此腳本 <https://github.com/google/perfetto/"
"blob/main/tools/record_android_trace>`_ 。"

msgid ""
"This will record for 10 seconds (per the configuration), or until you "
"press :kbd:`Ctrl + C`."
msgstr ""
"這會錄制 10 秒鐘（根據設定設定），或者直到你按下 :kbd:`Ctrl + C` 為止。"

msgid "Examining the trace"
msgstr "分析追蹤記錄"

msgid ""
"As soon as that script exits, it will launch the Perfetto UI in a web "
"browser."
msgstr ""
"一旦那個腳本執行完畢退出，它就會自動在網頁瀏覽器中打開 Perfetto 的視覺化介面"
"（UI）。"

msgid ""
"To see the Godot events, expand the row for your application by clicking on "
"its Android *Unique Name* / *Package Name* / *App ID* (Perfetto will also "
"include some events from system services in the trace)."
msgstr ""
"要查看Godot事件，請通過按一下您的應用的Android *唯一名稱* / *套件名稱* / *應"
"用ID* 來展開該應用的行（Perfetto還會在追蹤中包含一些來自系統服務的事件）。"

msgid "Then you can use the ``WASD`` keys to navigate the graph:"
msgstr "然後，你就可以用 ``WASD`` 這幾個鍵在圖表裡自由瀏覽啦："

msgid ""
"Press :kbd:`A` or :kbd:`D` to navigate forward or backward along the timeline"
msgstr "按下 :kbd:`A` 鍵或 :kbd:`D` 鍵，可以在時間軸上向前或向後瀏覽"

msgid "Press :kbd:`W` or :kbd:`S` to zoom in or out"
msgstr "按下 :kbd:`W` 或 :kbd:`S` 以放大或縮小"

msgid ""
"You'll probably need to zoom a bit before you're able to see the individual "
"events from Godot."
msgstr "你可能需要稍微放大一下檢視，才能看清 Godot 產生的那些具體事件。"

msgid ""
"To learn more, see the `Perfetto UI documentation <https://perfetto.dev/docs/"
"visualization/perfetto-ui>`_."
msgstr ""
"想瞭解更多詳情，可以查閱 `Perfetto UI documentation <https://perfetto.dev/"
"docs/visualization/perfetto-ui>`_。"
